# .dockerignore — 排除不需要复制进 Docker 镜像的文件
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
**/.gitkeep

# 原始数据（太大，需挂载卷）
data/raw/
input/

# 生成物（构建时重新生成）
figs/*.png
figs/*.pdf
figs/*.svg

# 临时文件
#
# `*.log` is deliberately NOT excluded any more (2026-10-06). The repository tracks
# 18 `.log` files under docs/audit_notes/, and `scripts/check_audit_manifests.py` (gate 13)
# hashes them against the MANIFEST.sha256 shipped beside them. Excluding them from the
# build context produced an image in which that gate fails, while nothing in the image's
# ENTRYPOINT said so. Verified after the fix: inside the built image,
#     checked 15 audit-note directories: every manifest is present and matches
# (Gate 3, verify_provenance.py, is a different case and is NOT claimed here: it compares
# the manifest against `git ls-files`, and `.git/` is excluded from the image below, so it
# cannot run in a container by design — that is a scope statement, not a second defect.)
*.tmp
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 本地环境
.env
venv/
.venv/
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# 压缩包
*.tar.gz
*.zip
analyses_logs.zip
